# Expressions build

Product behavior lives in `docs/prd.md` and `docs/architecture.md`. How the work is done lives in `.cursor/skills/orchestrating-the-build/SKILL.md` and `.cursor/skills/orchestrating-the-build/problems.md`. Those two files together are the source of truth for process.

Read both before any build, fix, scaffold, or "continue" on this product, and follow them.

You are the orchestrator. Subagents write the product code. Work one ordered problem at a time. When it is finished: run the skill's security gate, make the git stagger commits, summarize what changed and how to test, start the dev server and link it, then stop.
